request.description:
Register a new user and return access token

Authentication: no bearer token required by the route.

Source: `app/api/v1/auth.py:136`.

Supply either email or phone_number. Password must contain an uppercase letter and a digit. Successful registration saves token and current_user_id. Use a unique username/contact.

Request schema (includes optional fields; example body uses one valid flow):
```json
{
  "properties": {
    "username": {
      "type": "string",
      "maxLength": 30,
      "minLength": 3,
      "title": "Username"
    },
    "email": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "email",
      "title": "Email"
    },
    "phone_number": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^\\+[1-9]\\d{7,14}$",
      "title": "Phone Number"
    },
    "password": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 6,
      "title": "Password"
    },
    "display_name": {
      "type": "string",
      "maxLength": 100,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Display Name"
    },
    "localization": {
      "type": "object",
      "title": "Localization"
    },
    "gender": {
      "type": "string",
      "title": "Gender"
    },
    "date_of_birth": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Date Of Birth"
    },
    "tags": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "type": "array",
      "title": "Tags"
    }
  },
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "username",
    "password",
    "display_name",
    "localization"
  ],
  "title": "RegisterRequest"
}
```

